      "title": "Denial hotspots",
      "objective": "The denials team wants to know where denials cluster by setting. How does the denial rate differ by place of service, by whether prior authorisation was required, and by network status? Which denial reason codes dominate? Produce the standard artifacts (denial code ranking table, denial rate by segment table and chart, report).",
